                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "For such a cheap fighting game, I dont expect much from it, the story as expected is just a dull slideshow and the cosmetic is very limited, despite that, i had a ton of fun just button mashing and learning how each skill of each hero go against other hero, unlike games like tekken this game had a wider range of like skill or playstyle, i played with my friends some spammed basic attack some kept distance using a long range attack, there is the second games but honestly if you dont really care about larger pool of char this game is worth the purchase I think,",
